  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Pens in Vrchat have always been quite terrible, even before the IK changes, pens on avatars and in worlds, would require you to have the patience of a saint to slowly draw each letter. And now it almost always looks like chicken scratches, no matter how slowly you write.\nThere has however been, one exception to this (or two rather) The Presentation room world. (and the new vrchat home world which has pens)\nWhatever custom script is being used for the trails of those pens is by far the BEST pens in the entirety of vrchat. So why is it that the script is not whitelisted yet?\nEven if its not possible for avatars, then at the very least for worlds.\nIt would be an amazing feature to add.\nThank you",
